                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "f70b4b7f-e1e6-3a81-a77b-c3f2cd516171",
                        "entry_id": "6d7b8630-3ac5-37eb-b3d1-c618cebc0c65",
                        "glosses": [
                            "обманчивое видение, по суеверным представлениям — внушённое злой силой с целью соблазна"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "8998e1a4-989b-412b-a96a-f670c648b344",
                                "sense_id": "f70b4b7f-e1e6-3a81-a77b-c3f2cd516171",
                                "text": "На этот раз он не поскупился: подняв голову, Николай изумленно заметил, что наваждение исчезло и вокруг обычная вечерняя улица, пусть темноватая и мрачноватая, пусть затянутая тяжелым туманом, но все же одна из тех, где прошло его детство и юность, с обычными скупыми украшениями на стенах домов и подмигивающими тусклыми фонарями."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "dfb1aace-b074-49d6-b07d-43e8d83d3814",
                        "source_entry_id": "6d7b8630-3ac5-37eb-b3d1-c618cebc0c65",
                        "source_sense_id": "f70b4b7f-e1e6-3a81-a77b-c3f2cd516171",
                        "target_lang_word": "delusion",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "delusion",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b65c5f67-0aad-3119-891c-416703c18f47",
                                        "entry_id": "01f2ba35-7b53-37a6-b287-bf57d0e04947",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A false belief that is resistant to confrontation with actual facts."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "9b48afde-fd00-3bab-a31a-8ebc35a3c155",
                                        "entry_id": "01f2ba35-7b53-37a6-b287-bf57d0e04947",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The state of being deluded or misled, or process of deluding somebody."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "abb910c6-d85e-452e-a554-79315d527f0b",
                                                "sense_id": "9b48afde-fd00-3bab-a31a-8ebc35a3c155",
                                                "text": "It is far better to grasp the universe as it really is than to persist in delusion, however satisfying and reassuring."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "948fe042-766f-3be2-93ea-09570c54c1db",
                                        "entry_id": "01f2ba35-7b53-37a6-b287-bf57d0e04947",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "That which is falsely or delusively believed or propagated; false belief; error in belief."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9dc44280-25f4-4eed-9fff-eb781113fa77",
                                                "sense_id": "948fe042-766f-3be2-93ea-09570c54c1db",
                                                "text": "Hess, always a muddled man though not so doltish as Rosenberg, flew on his own to Britain under the delusion that he could arrange a peace settlement."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ba01b9b7-0d6d-43e4-9140-a86db0b3ecfd",
                                                "sense_id": "948fe042-766f-3be2-93ea-09570c54c1db",
                                                "text": "“Project Greenlight,” however, bore down on the soft underbelly of the movie business, focusing on the delusions and colossal blunders of first-time directors, seemingly selected as much for their unlovability as their talent."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "3d6f4064-0880-3ecd-b9f0-70cef3bffd97",
                                        "entry_id": "01f2ba35-7b53-37a6-b287-bf57d0e04947",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A fixed, false belief, that will not change, despite evidence to the contrary."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "a46ad429-31b3-457a-97db-3c8f3860cdd2",
                        "source_entry_id": "6d7b8630-3ac5-37eb-b3d1-c618cebc0c65",
                        "source_sense_id": "f70b4b7f-e1e6-3a81-a77b-c3f2cd516171",
                        "target_lang_word": "evil suggestion",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": []
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "886a571b-10c1-45ea-9dbc-ef4bb7d66ff0",
                        "source_entry_id": "6d7b8630-3ac5-37eb-b3d1-c618cebc0c65",
                        "source_sense_id": "f70b4b7f-e1e6-3a81-a77b-c3f2cd516171",
                        "target_lang_word": "obsession",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "obsession",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "9bdfdf70-f9aa-34f1-a2e3-36ac38a524d2",
                                        "entry_id": "bc34b5e2-7bab-3e67-a8fa-1eb8b7574f9e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The quality of being obsessed."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "9abf520e-0057-3469-8008-7f188964aebe",
                                        "entry_id": "bc34b5e2-7bab-3e67-a8fa-1eb8b7574f9e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An idea that engenders a compulsive or irrational preoccupation, or the preoccupation thereby engendered."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "6dbf1fbb-41c5-3de0-8d9a-f32982d7adfe",
                                        "entry_id": "bc34b5e2-7bab-3e67-a8fa-1eb8b7574f9e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An activity or entity that inspires a compulsive and potentially unhealthy fixation, or the fixation thereby inspired."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f9364c54-d98b-429d-bce3-8ad52a9b4951",
                                                "sense_id": "6dbf1fbb-41c5-3de0-8d9a-f32982d7adfe",
                                                "text": "Editing Wikipedia started as a hobby, but it's turned into a complete obsession of mine."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "edbe949b-55f4-3c58-95c4-5af2b8e7f7da",
                                        "entry_id": "bc34b5e2-7bab-3e67-a8fa-1eb8b7574f9e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Influence or control by evil spirits without possession."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6ff9816f-3f55-4fc5-af3f-458cf74817fe",
                                                "sense_id": "edbe949b-55f4-3c58-95c4-5af2b8e7f7da",
                                                "text": "if an evil spirit counterfeits the presence of God, and comes upon the man as an influence only, it may be described as obsession; but when a footing is gained in him, it is \"possession,\" because the obsessing spirits have gained access, and possess the ground they hold, up to the extent of the ground given."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a58b064a-2cdb-4e66-a5b8-ddfc438df31a",
                                                "sense_id": "edbe949b-55f4-3c58-95c4-5af2b8e7f7da",
                                                "text": "They should see that a perception of their identification with the Victor of Calvary is absolutely necessary if they are to constantly and victoriously resist the obsession of evil spirits."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "05dea325-10f9-4c62-8be4-0fd2112df1de",
                                                "sense_id": "edbe949b-55f4-3c58-95c4-5af2b8e7f7da",
                                                "text": "It is true, that by the workings of the law of attraction, and the susceptibility of mortals to the influence of spirit powers, mortals may become obsessed by the spirits of evil—that is evil spirits of men who once lived on earth—and this obsession may become so complete and powerful that the living mortal may lose all power to resist this influence of the evil spirits..."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
